# Version pins for the DDL application contract.
#
# Platform versions (Flink/Fluss) are PINNED (Option A, approved 2026).
# BROKER_PROTOCOL (go-arrow) is PINNED (see line 18). Remaining
# external/verification versions (Arrow API contract, schema lifecycle)
# stay TO_BE_VERIFIED until their contracts are captured and capability
# tests run.
#
# `make ddl` enforces the VERSION GATE on PLATFORM versions only
# (FLINK_VERSION, FLUSS_VERSION): absent / 'latest' / placeholder -> FAIL.
# DDL application stays blocked until capability evidence + the
# reconciliation blocker exit criteria are met (project rule: no DDL apply
# until pinned compatibility + schema lifecycle tests pass).
#
# See docs/08_implementation/01-foundation.md -> "Placeholder policy" (orig L178)
# and code/01_platform/02_sql/ddl/00_RECONCILIATION_BLOCKER.md.

FLINK_VERSION=2.2.1
FLUSS_VERSION=0.9.1-incubating
ZOOKEEPER_VERSION=3.9.2
BROKER_PROTOCOL=go-arrow-v0.0.0-20260622-7cce1630 (module:github.com/arrow-trade/go-arrow, upstream base 7cce1630 2026-06-22 + in-repo patches R-101..R-243, vendored third_party/go-arrow replace, tree sha256:f622f8a9a0cf4916869184d423523f819bd42202c256462466bf621e5e3af368) PINNED
ARROW_API_CONTRACT=v2026-05 (captured from Arrow_broker repo, docs/04_contracts/arrow_broker.md)
SCHEMA_LIFECYCLE=v1 (all 6 schema-state classes + 5 evolution classes implemented)

